<title>UK: Fannie Mae prices 1.0 bln stg Jun 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae prices 1.0 bln stg Jun 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following global bond has been priced, joint lead managers BZW and Merrill Lynch International Ltd said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The deal was launched on Tuesday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FEDERAL NATIONAL MORTGAGE ASSOCIATION</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN STG   COUPON     6.875     MATURITY    07.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.821    PAY DATE    19.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	REOFFER    99.821    SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.15	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.00 PCT GILT DUE 07.JUN.02</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
